317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 209 0 R
/T (Before we touch a single workout, we get clear on why. The people who actually build a lasting relationship with movement aren't the ones with the most discipline, they're just the ones with the clearest reason. Your habits around exercise were built over years by gym-class memories, before-and-after culture, and an industry telling you your body is a problem to fix. Is that resonating? )
/E (Before we touch a single workout, we get clear on why. The people who actually build a lasting relationship with movement aren't the ones with the most discipline, they're just the ones with the clearest reason. Your habits around exercise were built over years by gym-class memories, before-and-after culture, and an industry telling you your body is a problem to fix. Is that resonating? )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 209 0 R
/T (This chapter isn't about which workout to do. It's about remembering who you're doing this for, and deciding that person deserves care, not punishment. You don't have to earn the right to move, and you don't have to hate your body to change it. Movement is an act of self-respect and it begins long before you ever lace up.)
/E (This chapter isn't about which workout to do. It's about remembering who you're doing this for, and deciding that person deserves care, not punishment. You don't have to earn the right to move, and you don't have to hate your body to change it. Movement is an act of self-respect and it begins long before you ever lace up.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
