/P 210 0 R
/E (Here's something worth saying out loud: your relationship with exercise probably wasn't built in a gym. It was built in moments. Being picked last. A comment in a changing room. A fitness plan you "failed," that quietly taught you that your body and willpower couldn't be trusted.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
