333 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 210 0 R
/E (But that's also where the way out lives. Change doesn't begin when you finally find enough discipline. It begins the second you become aware of the loop and when you stop being a passive witness to your own story and start watching it with clarity. Movement isn't a punishment for the body you have. It's a way of caring for the body you live in.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
