457 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 215 0 R
/T (Because here's the thing, most of us were never actually taught how to train. We were handed a one-size punishment of a P.E. class, then graduated to tabloids and "transformation" culture that told us the goal was to shrink, to suffer, and to feel guilty when we rested. That's not fitness. That's the diet industry in workout clothes, and it's been talking over you your whole life.)
/E (Because here's the thing, most of us were never actually taught how to train. We were handed a one-size punishment of a P.E. class, then graduated to tabloids and "transformation" culture that told us the goal was to shrink, to suffer, and to feel guilty when we rested. That's not fitness. That's the diet industry in workout clothes, and it's been talking over you your whole life.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
458 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 215 0 R
/T (So let's turn the volume down on that voice and look at what's true. Your body is a living, working system, and movement is how you keep it capable. That capability comes from three main places, we call them the pillars.  )
/E (So let's turn the volume down on that voice and look at what's true. Your body is a living, working system, and movement is how you keep it capable. That capability comes from three main places, we call them the pillars.  )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7]
>>
