<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 252 0 R
/T (This guide was never about a perfect week or a finished version of you. It's about a relationship: one where movement is something you do for your body, not to it. Some weeks that will look like a full split. Some weeks it'll be one honest walk. Both count. Both are you keeping a promise to yourself. You always had the only tool you needed: a body worth respecting, and the willingness to  show up for it.)
