3292 0 obj
<<
/Title (This guide was never about a perfect week or a finished version of you. It's about a relationship: one where movement is something you do for your body, not to it. Some weeks that will look like a full split. Some weeks it'll be one honest walk. Both count. Both are you keeping a promise to yourself. You always had the only tool you needed: a body worth respecting, and the willingness to  show up for it.)
/Dest [56 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1875 0 R
/Prev 3291 0 R
>>
endobj
